        "https://checkstyle.org/dtds/suppressions_1_2.dtd">
<!--
  The one register of exceptions to the hand-written quality gates (spec NFR-001; research G3). It holds every
  exception to Checkstyle here, and records any exception to another gate (Error Prone, NullAway, doclint) as a
  comment entry, since those gates are never relaxed in source.

  Each entry carries, in the comment directly above it:
    rule:   the check that is suppressed
    file:   the file it applies to (also the `files` attribute)
    reason: why the code is right and the rule is wrong for it
    sunset: the date by which the entry is removed or re-justified

  Size: 0 entries.
-->
